examples.question_text:
The slope field below represents $\dfrac{dy}{dx}=1-\dfrac{x}{2}$.
(a) Explain why every vertical column has identical gradients.
(b) Identify the isocline with horizontal elements.
(c) Sketch the solution curve through $(0,1)$ and identify its turning point.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=9mm,y=9mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw[color=black,->] (-1.5,0)--(4.6,0) node[right] {$x$};
